{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/Game_Intro_Hero_Image.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Space Bross</strong></i>\u00a0is a thrilling blend of action\u00a0<i><strong>2.5D roguelite,</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Tower Defense</strong>\u00a0</i>genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/1.Gameplay_GIF.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a retired astronaut. You had one job: chill. But then they came for your chicken. Now it\u2019s personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set off on a chaotic journey across deep space in Space Bross, a roguelite tower defense action game where survival means lasers, loot, and a whole lot of clucking vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/2.Different_Planets.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dangerous, ever-changing alien worlds filled with secrets, traps, and absurd surprises. Each planet you land on brings new biomes, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/3._Turret_Placements.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the swarm hits, customize your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place turrets, reinforce your perimeter, and experiment with different defense combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s your strategy, customize it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/4.Skills.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When they come, they come hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash, shoot, and slam your way through relentless waves of alien freaks. Use your skills to stay alive, collect juicy loot, and protect what\u2019s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is fast, reactive, and just the right amount of ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/5._Skill_Tree.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle earns you upgrades, use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful gear, enhance your weapons, and evolve your tech tree to suit your playstyle. As the enemies grow stronger, so must you\u2026 or become space dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> is loud, chaotic, heartfelt, and just a little unhinged, exactly how saving a chicken in space should feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What Makes <strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> Awesome:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060<strong>2.5D Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Chaotic alien swarms &amp; intense boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Base customizing with tactical turret placement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Fast-paced combat and dynamic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Strategic depth mixed with arcade action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Yes. The chicken is real. And important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now, and prepare for the rescue mission of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2962280?t=1749033200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2962280?t=1749033200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/d130126cca8c07b4bbcebab58b69c0e87e48f1f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749033200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/d130126cca8c07b4bbcebab58b69c0e87e48f1f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749033200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/Game_Intro_Hero_Image.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Space Bross</strong></i>\u00a0is a thrilling blend of action\u00a0<i><strong>2.5D roguelite,</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Tower Defense</strong>\u00a0</i>genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/1.Gameplay_GIF.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a retired astronaut. You had one job: chill. But then they came for your chicken. Now it\u2019s personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set off on a chaotic journey across deep space in Space Bross, a roguelite tower defense action game where survival means lasers, loot, and a whole lot of clucking vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/2.Different_Planets.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dangerous, ever-changing alien worlds filled with secrets, traps, and absurd surprises. Each planet you land on brings new biomes, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/3._Turret_Placements.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the swarm hits, customize your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place turrets, reinforce your perimeter, and experiment with different defense combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s your strategy, customize it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/4.Skills.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When they come, they come hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash, shoot, and slam your way through relentless waves of alien freaks. Use your skills to stay alive, collect juicy loot, and protect what\u2019s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is fast, reactive, and just the right amount of ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/5._Skill_Tree.gif?t=1749033200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle earns you upgrades, use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful gear, enhance your weapons, and evolve your tech tree to suit your playstyle. As the enemies grow stronger, so must you\u2026 or become space dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> is loud, chaotic, heartfelt, and just a little unhinged, exactly how saving a chicken in space should feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What Makes <strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> Awesome:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060<strong>2.5D Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Chaotic alien swarms &amp; intense boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Base customizing with tactical turret placement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Fast-paced combat and dynamic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Strategic depth mixed with arcade action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u2060\u00a0 \u2060Yes. The chicken is real. And important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now, and prepare for the rescue mission of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>","developers":["Lavega Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/4b2cb06abe30f8a26649fe6d55286f6ed24bbac4/header.jpg?t=1749033200","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a92025 Lavega Games. All Rights Reserved. Space Bross is a trademark of Lavega Games. All other trademarks, logos, and brand names are the property of their respective owners. The use of these trademarks does not imply endorsement or affiliation.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux + SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB, OpenGL 3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen