s planets to bring your feathery friend back.","steam_appid":2962280,"support_info":{"email":"hello@lavegagames.com","url":"www.lavegagames.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}